PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY
Cybersecurity-focused Systems Engineer with 5+ years of experience designing, deploying, securing, and operating production IT infrastructure across enterprise and mid-sized business environments.
Hands-on background spanning systems engineering, cybersecurity, infrastructure, Zero Trust, cloud technologies, containerization, DevSecOps, automation, and observability. Growing specialization in CMMC and NIST-aligned security environments, with an emphasis on implementing secure, resilient, observable, automated, and auditable infrastructure.

Experienced in Linux administration, virtualized infrastructure, Docker, Kubernetes/k3s, AWS, Azure, NGINX, Cloudflare, GitHub Actions, Grafana, and Zero Trust Network Access.

Interested in the intersection of cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, drone technology, robotics, and autonomous systems.

